    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Build Your Own Feedback Bot\r\n\r\nCreate a chatbot to give you feedback on your Generate and Judge Project.\r\n\r\n1. Decide what kind of feedback would help you most and who you would want it from. For example: a skeptical peer, a younger student, an AI expert\r\n\r\n2. Fill in the system prompt: who is this bot and what should it do with your guide?\r\n\r\n3. Before you start testing your feedback bot, design your test. What specifically are you testing for? What will you change between tests? Write down your prediction for each variation before you run it.\r\n\r\n4. Run at least three different versions of your system prompt. For each one, record: what you changed, what you predicted would happen, and what actually happened.\r\n\r\n5. Test it by importing your project from your **Backpack** and adding it to the chat.\r\n\r\n6. If the feedback is not useful, fix your system prompt and try again.",
